  "bookId": "EZK",
  "reference": "Ezekieli 45",
  "verseCount": 25,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "45",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EZK 45"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "45",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Orwo mulyata ensi kuha buli ruganda omugabo gwarwo, mwihireho Omukama omwate, ebe wilaya ntakatifu, ey'oburai bw'emikono 25,000 n'obukika bw'emikono 20,000. Ewilaya yona egyo eliba ntakatifu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwonene omwo balilengamu ekichweka ekiganiraine embaju inai: Emikono 500; ekyo kiliba kya Rwensinga, ezingoirwe orubuga rw'emikono 50. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu wilaya ntakatifu egyo osharemu ekichweka ky'oburai bw'emikono 25,000 n'obukika bw'emikono 10,000. Omwo nimwo Rwensinga eligya, omwanya ogutakatifu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekichweka ekyo kiliba kitakatifu omu nsi ya Isiraeli. Kibe ky'abakuhani abakora Rwensinga, abangoba kunkolera. Guliba mwanya gwabo gw'obwombeko mara kichweka ky'ensi ekitakatifu aha rwa Rwensinga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekichweka ekindi eky'oburai bw'emikono 25,000 n'obukika bw'emikono 10,000, kiliba ky'Abalevita abakora Rwensinga. Obwo buliba butaka bwabo bw'okwombekamu ebigo by'okuturamu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aha rubaju rw'ekichweka ekyo ekyashazirweho kuba wilaya ntakatifu mube niho mushara obutaka bw'ekigo obw'oburai bw'emikono 25,000 n'obukika bw'emikono 5,000. Ekyo kiliba ky'eihanga lyona lya Isiraeli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kandi obutaka bw'omutwazi buliba aha mbaju zombili z'ewilaya ntakatifu n'obutaka bw'ekigo: Omu rubaju rw'ewilaya ntakatifu n'orw'obutaka bw'ekigo, mukono ogw'obugwaizoba n'ogw'oburugaizoba. Omu burai kiganirane n'oburai obw'omwate gw'oruganda rumoi, kyeme obugwaizoba kigobe aha rubibi rw'ensi mukono ogw'oburugaizoba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obwo buliba butaka bw'omutwazi omuli Isiraeli. Mara abatwazi bange batalishuba kushasa bantu bange. Ensi esigaire bagilekere Abaisiraeli n'enganda zabo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Inye Ruhanga Omukama ningamba nti: Nikimara, inywe ba Baisiraeli. Mulekere okugwara n'okushasa abantu. Mukore ebiina amazima n'obugorogoki. Mutalishubira kubinga bantu bange mu mataka gabo. Alikugamba n'inye Ruhanga Omukama.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Eminzani, efa n'ebati, mukoze eby'amazima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Efa n'ebati bigire ekipimo kimoi: Ebati eiganirane n'ekichweka kya ikumi ky'ehomeri; efa nayo eiganirane n'ekichweka kya ikumi ky'ehomeri. Kandi ehomeri ebe niyo eba y'okulengeraho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eshekeli egire egera 20. Eshekeli 5 zibe shekeli 5; eshekeli 10 zibe shekeli 10; kandi emina yanyu egire eshekeli 20.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ebihongo byanyu bibe biti: Buli homeri emoi y'engano mugihyeho ekichweka kya mukaga kya efa. Kandi buli homeri y'eshayiri nayo mugihyeho ekichweka kya mukaga kya efa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekipimo ky'amajuta ekilikuragirwa: Buli kori (ekori neshusha ehomeri, einamu ebati ikumi) mugihyeho ekichweka kya ikumi ky'ebati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli ka omuli Isiraeli buli buhyo bw'entaama 200 ehongemu entama emoi. Mugire ebihongo by'ensano, ebihongo by'okwokibwa, ebihongo by'emilembe, aha rw'enyatano y'amafu ganyu. Alikugamba n'inye Ruhanga Omukama.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Abanyansi bona barataga kuha omutwazi wa Isiraeli ebihongo ebi byona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi omutwazi wenene niwe araragirwaga kugira ebihongo by'okwokibwa, ebihongo eby'ensano, ebihongo eby'okunywa, ebihongo eby'aha biro bikuru n'aha kwezi kwemire n'aha Sabato zona, n'aha biro bikuru byona ebiragiirwe eby'eihanga lya Isiraeli: Agire ebihongo by'enyatano y'amafu, ebihongo by'okwokibwa, ebihongo by'ensano n'ebihongo by'emilembe aha rw'okwatilira eihanga lya Isiraeli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Inye Ruhanga Omukama ningamba nti: Aha kiro kya mbere ky'omwezi gwa mbere, okwate enumi y'ekigeto etaina kamogo, oshemeze Rwensinga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukuhani akwateho obwamba bw'ekitunganwa ekyaitwa aha rw'enyatano y'obufu abusiige emizilingiti ya Rwensinga, epembe inai z'omukugiro gwa alutare, n'aha mizilingiti y'ekihigi kya nyakabuga ey'omunda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okorega otyo n'aha kiro kya mushanju ky'omwezi aha rw'omuntu wena wena afakaize ekyekundo anga afakazibwe obutamanya. Nikwo arataga kuhasilira atyo Rwensinga.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aha kiro kya ikumi na biinai ky'omwezi, murashemezaga ekiro kikuru kya Pasika, ebiro mushanju nimulya omugate ogutaina itumbyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha kiro ekyo kyonene omutwazi agire enumi y'ekigeto aha kwatilira amafu aha rwa wenene n'abanyansi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu biro mushanju by'ekiro kikuru, buli kiro atambire Omukama ekihongo ky'okwokibwa: Nizo zona hamoi enumi z'ebigeto mushanju n'empaya z'entama mushanju ezitaina kamogo. Ateho n'empaya y'embuzi aha rw'ekihongo ky'enyatano y'amafu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
