              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha kiro kya ikumi na bitanu ky'omwezi gwa mushanju aha kiro kikuru ky'ensisira eky'ebiro mushanju, omutwazi agire ebihongo byonene byonene ebyo aha rw'enyatano y'amafu, eby'okwokibwa, eby'ensano n'eby'amajuta.”",
          "type": "text",
